## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.7 Max
- **Short description:** Alibaba’s proprietary Qwen 3.7 Max agent model for long-horizon coding and office automation workflows (per local metadata).
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud / Qwen hosted APIs and third-party routers (e.g. OpenRouter listing). Local metadata lists `opencode/qwen-3.7-max` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Official blog page not accessible in this pass (404). Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `qwen-3.7-max`, `qwen/qwen3.7-max` (provider-specific).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 total tokens; 131,072 max output (local metadata/OpenRouter context).
- **Modalities:** Text in/out (local metadata states text-only).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Hosted pricing varies by provider (OpenRouter lists ~$1.475/$4.425 per 1M in/out for Alibaba Cloud Int. standard variant in reviewed page snippet; local metadata cites $1.48/$4.43).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Alibaba model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

